N'S 43RD ANNUAL HEALTH CARE CONFERENCE", 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS , FEB. 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) WILL PARTICIPATE IN COWEN'S 43RD ANNUAL HEALTH CARE CONFERENCE ON MONDAY, MARCH 6, 2023.\xa0MIKE MASON, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT, LILLY DIABETES AND OBESITY, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT 1:30 P.M."}{'symbol': 'ENPH', 'date': '2023-02-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'ENPHASE ENERGY LAUNCHES IQ BATTERIES IN AUSTRIA', 'text': "FREMONT, CALIF., FEB. 21, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ENPHASE ENERGY, INC. (NASDAQ: ENPH), A GLOBAL ENERGY TECHNOLOGY COMPANY AND THE WORLD'S LEADING SUPPLIER OF MICROINVERTER-BASED SOLAR AND BATTERY SYSTEMS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS STARTED SHIPPING IQ™\xa0BATTERIES TO CUSTOMERS IN AUSTRIA, FURTHER EXPANDING THE PRODUCT'S AVAILABILITY IN THE EUROPEAN MARKET. IQ BATTERIES ARE ALSO CURRENTLY AVAILABLE TO CUSTOMERS IN BELGIUM, GERMANY, AND NORTH AMERICA."}{'symbol': 'EQR', 'date': '2023-02-20 08:30:00', 'title': 'EQUITY RESIDENTIAL PUBLISHES INVESTOR PRESENTATION', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EQUITY RESIDENTIAL (NYSE: EQR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IN CONNECTION WITH UPCOMING INVESTOR MEETINGS, THE COMPANY HAS POSTED AN UPDATED INVESTOR PRESENTATION TO ITS WEBSITE. THE PRESENTATION CAN BE FOUND IN THE INVESTOR SECTION OF WWW.EQUITYAPARTMENTS.COM. ABOUT EQUITY RESIDENTIAL EQUITY RESIDENTIAL IS COMMITTED TO CREATING COMMUNITIES WHERE PEOPLE THRIVE.'}{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2023-02-20 14:14:00', 'title': 'YOUNG WOMEN IN ILLINOIS CAN APPLY TO BUILD, RACE ELECTRIC-POWERED RACECARS IN COMED EV RALLY', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WITH WOMEN'S HISTORY MONTH JUST AROUND THE CORNER, COMED IS EXCITED TO ANNOUNCE THE RETURN OF ITS SIGNATURE SCIENCE, TECHNOLOGY, ENGINEERING AND MATH (STEM) PROGRAM FOR FUTURE WOMEN'S HISTORY-MAKERS, THE COMED EV RALLY. YOUNG WOMEN IN ILLINOIS CAN NOW APPLY TO PARTICIPATE IN THE ANNUAL SUMMER EVENT, A COMPETITION THAT CHALLENGES TEEN GIRLS TO BUILD AND RACE HIGH-TECH, ELECTRIC-POWERED GO-CARTS."}{'symbol': 'EXPD', 'date': '2023-02-21 08:30:00', 'title': 'EXPEDITORS REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER 2022 EPS OF $1.38', 'text': 'SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EXPEDITORS INTERNATIONAL OF WASHINGTON, INC. (NASDAQ:EXPD) TODAY ANNOUNCED FOURTH QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS INCLUDING THE FOLLOWING HIGHLIGHTS COMPARED TO THE SAME QUARTER OF 2021: DILUTED NET EARNINGS ATTRIBUTABLE TO SHAREHOLDERS PER SHARE (EPS1) DECREASED 48% TO $1.38 NET EARNINGS ATTRIBUTABLE TO SHAREHOLDERS DECREASED 52% TO $219 MILLION OPERATING INCOME DECREASED 47% TO $330 MILLION REVENUES DECREASED 36% TO $3.'}{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2023-02-21 13:05:00', 'title': 'FEDEX TO HOST DRIVE PROGRAM UPDATE ON APRIL 5, 2023', 'text': 'MEMPHIS, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FEDEX CORP. ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL HOST ITS DRIVE INVESTOR EVENT ON WEDNESDAY, APRIL 5, 2023 BEGINNING AT 8:30 A.M. ET.'}{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2023-02-21 09:40:00', 'title': 'FEDEX DELIVERS CRITICAL AID, COMMITS MORE THAN $1 MILLION AMID EARTHQUAKE CRISIS IMPACTING TURKEY AND SYRIA', 'text': 'MEMPHIS, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FEDEX CORP. (NYSE: FDX) CONTINUES TO SUPPORT THOSE AFFECTED BY THE CATASTROPHIC EARTHQUAKES THAT HAVE DEVASTATED SOUTHERN TURKEY AND NORTHERN SYRIA, COMMITTING MORE THAN $1,000,000 (USD) WORTH OF IN-KIND SHIPPING SO FAR. OVERNIGHT, THE COMPANY CHARTERED A FEDEX MD-11 OF DEDICATED RELIEF FROM DUBAI, UAE, TO ISTANBUL, TURKEY.'}{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2023-02-21 02:00:00', 'title': "WORLDPAY FROM FIS ANNOUNCES THE PRINCE'S TRUST AS OFFICIAL CHARITY PARTNER IN THE UK", 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIS® (NYSE: FIS), A GLOBAL LEADER IN FINANCIAL SERVICES TECHNOLOGY, HAS JOINED THE PRINCE'S TRUST AS AN OFFICIAL CHARITY PARTNER IN THE UK TO HELP YOUNG PEOPLE BUILD THE CONFIDENCE AND SKILLS THEY NEED TO REACH THEIR FULL POTENTIAL."}{'symbol': 'GIS', 'date': '2023-02-21 06:30:00', 'title': 'GENERAL MILLS ADVANCES ACCELERATE STRATEGY TO DELIVER TOP-TIER SHAREHOLDER RETURNS', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS